 and photomask repair and cleaning equipment. In addition, the company offers advanced optical fluorescence microscopy instruments; services for transcriptional profiling and multiomic analysis; superconducting materials, such as metallic low temperature superconductors; multifilament round and rectangular LTS wires in both monolithic and wire-in-channel formats; designs and manufactures Cuponal; metallic low temperature superconductors; and non-superconducting high technology tools, such as synchrotron and beamline instrumentation. Bruker Corporation was founded in 1960 and is headquartered in Billerica, Massachusetts.","employees":11085,"website":"https://www.bruker.com","country":"United States","city":"Billerica","officers":[{"name":"Dr. Frank H. Laukien Ph.D.","title":"Chairman, CEO & President"},{"name":"Mr. Gerald N. Herman CPA","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Dr. Mark R. Munch Ph.D.","title":"Corporate Executive VP and President of Bruker Nano Group & Corporate"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":19.17,"tpe":29.98,"ps":4.488,"pfcf":28.95,"peg":1.365,"pb":4.556,"ev_ebitda":16.93,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.1735,"eps_growth_fwd":0.09465,"eps_growth_next":0.1197,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01872,"roa":0.02349,"de":41.94,"gross_margin":0.4961,"op_margin":0.03472,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.1},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":25.8,"sector":19.17,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":29.98,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.699,"sector":4.488,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":52.5,"sector":28.95,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.52,"sector":1.365,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":3.966,"sector":4.556,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":76.16,"sector":41.94,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.052,"sector":0.1,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_